{"version":1,"content":"<p>全球電子代工巨頭富士康正在進一步擴大其美國人工智能硬件業務版圖。最新公開的房地產文件顯示，富士康已在加利福尼亞州聖克拉拉購入兩處相鄰工業地產，總建築面積約11.01萬平方英尺，外界普遍認為這些設施未來將被用於人工智能相關硬件和伺服器設備的生產製造。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583236.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.953482+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:35:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"6cf3d3013ea53787ebf3a4d3c9aaef5b95e6e0fc48d5f708183f0ec21ae9c391","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}